      },
      "message": "refactor(sim): a carried field clips to the next setup's block by intersection\n\n#637 step C: CarriedField gains an optional clip block in the new frame,\nevaluated as max(d_body, d_block) - the field's form of the column\nbody's lower() clip to a later setup's own stock. A second clip narrows\nthe block, never widens it; carrying the body again (then) carries the\nclip through the same turn. box_signed is the exact signed distance to\nan axis-aligned box (negative inside).\n\nPinned by field_carry (+2): the clipped distance is exactly\nmax(body, block) and membership is body AND block at every sample; a\nsecond clip only narrows; box_signed's inside, outside, corner and face\nvalues.\n\nRefs #637\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
